---
source: crates/beforerunit-core/tests/progression.rs
expression: "progression(\"sudo dd if=ubuntu.iso of=/dev/sda bs=4M\")"
---
s                                        | IDLE     Typing command...
su                                       | CAUTION  Switches user. Default is a root shell.
sud                                      | IDLE     Typing command...
sudo                                     | CAUTION  Runs the next command as administrator.
sudo d                                   | IDLE     Typing command...
sudo dd                                  | CAUTION  Copies raw data. Waiting for output target...
sudo dd if=ubuntu.iso of=                | CAUTION  Writes raw data to "".
sudo dd if=ubuntu.iso of=/               | DANGER   Changes your entire system. Can break booting.
sudo dd if=ubuntu.iso of=/d              | CAUTION  Writes raw data to "/d".
sudo dd if=ubuntu.iso of=/de             | CAUTION  Writes raw data to "/de".
sudo dd if=ubuntu.iso of=/dev            | DANGER   Changes system folder "/dev". Can break the OS.
sudo dd if=ubuntu.iso of=/dev/           | DANGER   Changes system folder "/dev/". Can break the OS.
sudo dd if=ubuntu.iso of=/dev/s          | CAUTION  Writes raw data to "/dev/s".
sudo dd if=ubuntu.iso of=/dev/sd         | DANGER   Overwrites disk "/dev/sd". All data lost.
sudo dd if=ubuntu.iso of=/dev/sda        | DANGER   Overwrites disk "/dev/sda". All data lost.
